%% Insurance Claims DApp - Claim State Diagram
%% Paste into https://mermaid.live to edit and export as PNG/SVG
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Submitted : submitClaim(amount, evidenceHash)<br/>[policy.active && amount <= coverage]

    Submitted --> Approved : approveClaim(id)<br/>[onlyInsurer]
    Submitted --> Rejected : rejectClaim(id)<br/>[onlyInsurer]

    Approved --> Paid : payClaim(id)<br/>[onlyInsurer && balance >= amount]

    Paid --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    note right of Submitted
        enum ClaimStatus
        { Submitted, Approved, Rejected, Paid }
    end note

    note right of Paid
        status set to Paid BEFORE transfer
        (checks-effects-interactions)
    end note
